                   Protected.FlowId ]
  Replaced.{ FlowId Launched }
  ReplaceRejection.[ PredecessorAbsent
                     UnknownPredecessor
                     PredecessorStopped
                     LaunchRefused.StartRejection ; the successor's start was refused
