  ; SeatEvidence is what Flow read when a caller could not be named: the pane
  ; the caller ran in, the label Herdr shows for that pane, the native session
  ; the pane's agent runs as far as it was read, when it was read, and the
  ; caller's process. It is raw evidence; the caller stays unidentified and
  ; no identity is invented from it. A caller in no pane Flow reads has no
  ; pane and no label.
  SeatEvidence.{ Option<SeatPane> Option<PaneLabel> Option<NativeSessionId> ObservedAt Process }
