  ; Started: the harness's session started (Claude's SessionStart), naming
  ; the native session Claude Code gave the hook. One that follows the
  ; flow's own Cleared rebinds the flow to that session; the FlowId stays.
  ; Ended: the harness's session ended (Claude's SessionEnd), naming the
  ; native session Claude Code gave the hook; Flow records the flow Exited
  ; when it is the flow's own session.
  ; Cleared: the session was cleared (Claude's SessionEnd with reason
  ; clear), naming the session that ended. The harness goes on in a new
  ; session: the flow has not exited and its pane stays.
